<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Sammi Steel 96 net loss jumps.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Sammi Steel 96 net loss jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both loss)		   2,726    vs   904</p>
<p>    Net (both loss)			    119.98 vs    39.45</p>
<p>    Turnover				     860.09 vs 1,000.68</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     4.78 (gain) vs 8.25 (loss)</p>
<p>NOTE - Sammi Steel Co is a maker of specialty steel products, such as cold-rolled stainless steel plates. A company official said its loss widened due mainly to heavy financial costs, but gave no details. Its share capital rose by 333,694 shares in 1996 to 48.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom 822-727-5646</p>
</text>
